#: ../../../policy/CMP0227.rst:2
msgid "CMP0227"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0227.rst:6
msgid "AIX shared objects are named with ``VERSION`` and ``SOVERSION``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0227.rst:8
msgid ""
"On AIX, when :prop_tgt:`AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_ARCHIVE` is disabled, a "
"``SHARED`` library target is built as a plain shared object ``.so`` file. "
"CMake 4.5 and below ignore the :prop_tgt:`VERSION` and :prop_tgt:`SOVERSION` "
"target properties for such files because AIX shared objects have no builtin "
"soname, so only a single ``lib<name>.so`` file is produced. CMake 4.6 added "
"the :prop_tgt:`AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS` target property to name the "
"shared object with :prop_tgt:`VERSION` and create :prop_tgt:`SOVERSION` and "
"unversioned symlinks to it, as on other UNIX platforms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0227.rst:18
msgid ""
"CMake 4.6 and above prefer, when :prop_tgt:`AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS` is "
"not set, to enable versioned names and symlinks by default. This policy "
"provides compatibility for projects that have not been updated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0227.rst:22
msgid ""
"The ``OLD`` behavior for this policy is to disable versioned names and "
"symlinks when :prop_tgt:`AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS` is not set. The "
"``NEW`` behavior for this policy is to enable versioned names and symlinks "
"when :prop_tgt:`AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS` is not set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/include/STANDARD_ADVICE.rst:1
msgid ""
"This policy was introduced in CMake version |INTRODUCED_IN_CMAKE_VERSION|. "
"It may be set by :command:`cmake_policy` "
"or :command:`cmake_minimum_required`. If it is not set, CMake |"
"WARNS_OR_DOES_NOT_WARN|, and uses ``OLD`` behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/include/DEPRECATED.rst:2
msgid ""
"The ``OLD`` behavior of a policy is :ref:`deprecated by definition <cmake-"
"policies-intro>` and may be removed in a future version of CMake."
msgstr ""
